<DOCUMENT>
<TYPE>EX-99.1
<SEQUENCE>2
<FILENAME>ea026997901ex99-1_hubcyber.htm
<DESCRIPTION>PROXY STATEMENT FOR THE MEETING TO BE HELD ON DECEMBER 30, 2025.
<TEXT>
<HTML>
<HEAD><TITLE></TITLE></HEAD>
<BODY STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;text-justify-trim: punctuation; margin: 0; padding: 10pt;"><DIV STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;width:600px;margin: 0 auto;">
	<DIV CLASS="_idGenObjectStyleOverride-1" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;border-width:0pt;">
		<P CLASS="Text_flush" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:3;text-align:right;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Exhibit 99.1</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="Text_flush" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;"><IMG ALT="" SRC="thub_logo.jpg" STYLE="width:195.84px;max-width:100%;"></FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="H1" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:1;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:center;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:10pt;margin-top:10pt;"><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;">HUB Cyber Security Ltd.</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="Text_flush" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:3;margin-top:10pt;text-align:right;margin-top:10pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">December&#x00a0;16, 2025</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="Text_flush" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:3;margin-top:10pt;margin-top:10pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">Dear Shareholder,</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:10pt;margin-top:10pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">You are cordially invited to attend a Special General Meeting of Shareholders (the &#x201c;</FONT><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;">Meeting</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">&#x201d;) of HUB Cyber Security Ltd. (&#x201c;</FONT><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;">HUB</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">&#x201d; or the &#x201c;</FONT><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;">Company</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">&#x201d;), to be held at HUB&#x2019;s offices at 2 Kaplan Street, Tel Aviv 6473403, Israel on December&#x00a0;30, 2025, at 10:30&#x00a0;a.m., Israel time.</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:10pt;margin-top:10pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">At the Meeting, the Company&#x2019;s shareholders will be asked to consider and vote on the matter described in the enclosed Notice of Special General Meeting of Shareholders (the &#x201c;</FONT><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;">Notice</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">&#x201d;). HUB&#x2019;s board of directors unanimously recommends that you vote &#x201c;FOR&#x201d; the proposal set forth in the Notice.</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:10pt;margin-top:10pt;"><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;">Whether or not you plan to attend the Meeting, it is important that your shares be represented and voted at the Meeting. Accordingly, after reading the enclosed Notice and proxy statement, please sign, date and mail the enclosed proxy card in the envelope provided or if you hold your shares in street name and the proxy card allows this, vote by telephone or over the Internet in accordance with the instructions on your proxy card.</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:10pt;margin-top:10pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">We urge all of our shareholders to review our annual report on Form&#x00a0;20</FONT><FONT CLASS="nobreak" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">-F</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;"> furnished to the U.S.&#x00a0;Securities and Exchange Commission (the &#x201c;</FONT><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;">SEC</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">&#x201d;) on Form&#x00a0;6</FONT><FONT CLASS="nobreak" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">-K</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">, which is available on our website at </FONT><FONT CLASS="Italic" STYLE="font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;font-size:11pt;">www.hubsecurity.com</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;"> or on the SEC&#x2019;s website </FONT><FONT CLASS="Italic" STYLE="font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;font-size:11pt;">at www.sec.gov</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">.</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:10pt;margin-top:10pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:11pt;">We look forward to greeting as many of you as can attend the Meeting.</FONT></P>
		<TABLE CLASS="No-Table-Style" STYLE="width: 100.0%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 0px solid #000; border-width: 0pt; margin: 10pt 0 10pt 0;">


				<TR CLASS="No-Table-Style _idGenTableRowColumn-4" STYLE="height:12pt;">
